    <h2>Which Breakfast Item Should You Order?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Best value</strong> — Breakfast Burrito at $3.49. Quick, portable, satisfying at 380 calories.</li>
      <li><strong>Most filling</strong> — Country Breakfast Platter at $6.99. The full DQ morning in one order.</li>
      <li><strong>Lightest option</strong> — Breakfast Burrito or Biscuit &amp; Gravy.</li>
      <li><strong>Highest calorie</strong> — Country Breakfast Platter at 860 cal.</li>
      <li><strong>Best for sweet tooth</strong> — French Toast Platter or Buttermilk Pancake Platter.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>DQ Breakfast vs. McDonald's and Burger King</h2>
    <p>DQ's breakfast is a comfort-food, Southern-influenced lineup rather than a broad national menu. The Country Gravy appears across multiple items (Biscuit &amp; Gravy, Country Breakfast Platter, Chicken &amp; Gravy Burrito) and is DQ's defining breakfast flavor. DQ does not serve Egg McMuffin-style breakfast sandwiches. It is a sit-down style breakfast menu compressed into a fast-food format.</p>
